# Copy to `.env.local` (not committed). Next.js loads it for dev and build.

# --- Photography CDN (2–4 GB+ site-wide) ---------------------------------
# Use a public HTTPS origin for next/image. Do not store large originals in Git.
# Options: Cloudflare R2 + custom domain, AWS S3 + CloudFront, Cloudinary, Bunny, etc.
# Example hostname you control: media.togstrek.com → point DNS + TLS to your bucket/CDN.
NEXT_PUBLIC_MEDIA_BASE_URL=https://media.togstrek.com

# Bandwidth: CDN edge caches reduce origin egress; R2→Cloudflare has no egress fee.
# Repo size: keep only code + small assets; images referenced by URL in MDX/frontmatter.
